            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Xeo Vo Van Kiet",
            "review_text": "TrickTrip\nVatican City, Italy35 contributions\n0\nDaNang specialties\nSep 2019 • Business\nthis has become my favorite place (their location near My Khe beach) for central coast-style coconut salad, gỏi bưởi, and the lemongrass herbal drink (see below). upstairs is air conditioned and large with ample space, so usually held lunch meetings here with small groups of 4 or 5. And I love the basket of greens and herbs that come with the grilled pork. \n\ntrà cù lao - tea of lemongrass (sả), lime (chanh), licorice (cam thảo), camomile (cúc bach), artichoke (atiso), jujube (táo tàu), siraitia grosvenorii (la hán), and basil seed (hạt é)\nWritten October 9, 2019",
